  "ID": "63737",
  "post_title": "El baterista ondense Pedro Corral hace vibrar Rellamp y Cafè Druida",
  "post_date": "2016-06-24 19:26:52",
  "post_name": "el-baterista-ondense-pedro-corral-hace-vibrar-rellamp-y-cafe-druida",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_5312.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(68 fotos) El baterista profesional ondense Pedro Corral ha tenido una intensa tarde-noche de San Juan, primero con un cl&iacute;nic en el local de la asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp y despu&eacute;s encabezando una jam session en Caf&egrave; Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_5338.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Le han acompa&ntilde;ado en principio Joan Fonfria a la guitarra y Andr&eacute;s Mauricio Bedoya al bajo. Con &eacute;ste &uacute;ltimo han actuado tambi&eacute;n Serfio Fern&aacute;ndez Vidal a la bater&iacute;a y el jovenc&iacute;simo Nacho Ribes a la guitarra. Otro tr&iacute;o ha sido protagonizado por Javi Castillo al bajo, C&eacute;sar P&eacute;rez a la guitarra y Bernardo Novella a la percusi&oacute;n (41 fotos).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_6299.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El 21 de mayo, el local de Rellamp acogi&oacute; un concurrido concierto en el retorno del m&iacute;tico tr&iacute;o Sepelaco Rock, que tuvieron como teloneros a los tambi&eacute;n veteranos Gaseosos (27 fotos).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5308.jpg\" alt=\"img_5308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5309.jpg\" alt=\"img_5309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5310.jpg\" alt=\"img_5310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5311.jpg\" alt=\"img_5311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5312.jpg\" alt=\"img_5312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5313.jpg\" alt=\"img_5313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5314.jpg\" alt=\"img_5314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5315.jpg\" alt=\"img_5315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5317.jpg\" alt=\"img_5317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5318.jpg\" alt=\"img_5318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5319.jpg\" alt=\"img_5319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5320.jpg\" alt=\"img_5320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5321.jpg\" alt=\"img_5321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pedrocorralrellampidruidasepelecorellamp/img_5323.jpg\" alt=\"img_5323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2